{"deploy_id":"6acf61fbc339faabe3f3d7ec","path":"recipes/index.html","size":2082,"body":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>OffMenu \u2014 held recipe catalogue</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/recipes/gallery/style.css\"><body><header><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/recipes/\">offmenu<span>RECIPE CATALOGUE</span></a><span class=\"privacy\">Published recipe catalogue \u00b7 original source details</span></header><main><section class=\"intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">WHAT WE HAVE, AND WHAT WE KNOW</span><h1>Browse the recipe collection.<br>Every source stays visible.</h1><p>Browse the actual indexed recipe records, with original ingredients, directions, language, source and review limits. Missing information stays missing.</p><div class=\"coverage\" id=\"coverage\" role=\"status\">Reading the direct inventory\u2026</div></section><form id=\"filters\"><label>Find a recipe<input type=\"search\" id=\"query\" placeholder=\"Search titles, sources or review status\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><label>Source<select id=\"source\"><option value=\"\">All indexed sources</option></select></label><label>Language<select id=\"language\"><option value=\"\">All available languages</option></select></label><label>Licence<select id=\"licence\"><option value=\"\">All recorded licences</option></select></label><label>Collection<select id=\"collection\"><option value=\"\">All inspected collections</option></select></label><button>Search</button></form><div class=\"results-head\"><h2 id=\"result-count\">Recipe records</h2><div><button id=\"previous\" type=\"button\">Previous</button><span id=\"page\"></span><button id=\"next\" type=\"button\">Next</button></div></div><p id=\"error\" role=\"alert\"></p><div id=\"recipes\" class=\"grid\"></div></main><dialog id=\"detail\"><button id=\"close\" class=\"close\" aria-label=\"Close recipe details\">Close \u00d7</button><div id=\"detail-body\"></div></dialog><footer>Food matches, dietary suitability, nutrition, origin and planning acceptance are not inferred from a recipe listing. Source rights and review flags remain attached.</footer><script type=\"module\" src=\"/recipes/gallery/app.js\"></script></body></html>\n"}